-Methods to set the mask type for volume rendering, either Binary or LabelMap. To set binary mask: `this->MaskType = vtkGPUMultiVolumeRayCastMapper::BinaryMaskType`. To set label map mask: `this->MaskType = vtkGPUMultiVolumeRayCastMapper::LabelMapMaskType` [S2, unofficial].
+### [Mask Type Configuration](2937-mask-type-configuration.md)
+Methods to set the mask type for volume rendering, either Binary or LabelMap. To set binary mask: `this->MaskType = vtkGPUMultiVolumeRayCastMapper::BinaryMaskType`. To set label map mask: `this->MaskType = vtkGPUMultiVolumeRayCastMapper::LabelMapMaskType`.
 
